0233   0000             M4B50                  .EQU $4B50       ;Alien0 movement pattern table MSB
0234   0000             M4B51                  .EQU $4B51       ;Alien0 movement pattern table LSB
0235   0000             M4B52                  .EQU $4B52       ;Alien1 movement pattern table MSB
