3423   0F00             ;*****************************************************************************
3424   0F00             ;* 'Alien with player' collision check.
3425   0F00             ;* MAME cheat code "Invisibility for aliens": Set $0F00 to $C9 (RET)
3426   0F00             ;* Uses a 2x2 box normally; a 4x4 box when the shield/explosion state is high.
3427   0F00             ;* This is the counterpart to the bullet vs alien check:
3428   0F00             ;* It asks "has a diving alien run into the player's ship?".
3429   0F00             ;* - Box size depends on the shield (`ShieldCount`, `$43A6`).
3430   0F00             ;*   If it's below `$C0`, `L0F00` uses a 2×2 collision box around the ship.
3431   0F00             ;*   If it's `$C0` or higher (shield up / ship showing explosion tiles),
3432   0F00             ;*   it branches to `L0F74`, which uses a larger 4×4 box and a wider vertical band.
3433   0F00             ;* - `L0F56` is the fast screen test.
3434   0F00             ;*   Given the ship's screen address and a `cols × rows` size,
3435   0F00             ;*   It reads each character cell the ship occupies.
3436   0F00             ;*   If any cell holds an alien glyph (`$60`–`$BF`) it immediately jumps to `L0CF4`
3437   0F00             ;*   to handle the player being hit.
3438   0F00             ;*   If it walks the whole box with no alien, it returns with `Z` set ("no collision").
3439   0F00             ;* - `L0F38` / `L0FA6` identify and kill the offending alien.
3440   0F00             ;*   After a collision is detected, the caller derives the ship's horizontal bounds (`B`,`C`)
3441   0F00             ;*   and scans all 16 alien slots at `$4B70`. For each active alien
3442   0F00             ;*   it checks that the alien's Y is in the player's bottom band
3443   0F00             ;*   (small box `($D2,$E7)`, big box `($CA,$EF)`) and its X overlaps the ship (`B ≤ X < C`).
3444   0F00             ;*   On a match it loads the animation/score values into `DE` (`$0D04` small, `$0D02` big),
3445   0F00             ;*   rewinds `HL` to the alien's control byte, and jumps to `L0EAD`
3446   0F00             ;*   (the shared "enemy destroyed" tail, same one used by the bullet kill path) to blow the alien up.
3447   0F00             ;*****************************************************************************
3448   0F00             L0F00:
3449   0F00 21 A6 43                           LD      HL,ShieldCount      ; 
3450   0F03 7E                                 LD      A,(HL)              ;
3451   0F04 FE C0                              CP      $C0                 ;
3452   0F06 D2 74 0F                           JP      NC,L0F74            ; 
3453   0F09 2E E2                              LD      L,$E2               ;
3454   0F0B 56                                 LD      D,(HL)              ; get $43E2 PlayerShipMSB
3455   0F0C 2C                                 INC     L                   ;
3456   0F0D 5E                                 LD      E,(HL)              ; get $43E3 PlayerShipLSB
3457   0F0E 01 02 02                           LD      BC,$0202            
3458   0F11 CD 56 0F                           CALL    L0F56               ; 'alien with player' collision check
3459   0F14 C8                                 RET     Z                   ; if no collision
3460   0F15 00                                 NOP                         
3461   0F16 00                                 NOP                         
3462   0F17 21 9E 43                           LD      HL,M439E            ; Mapped player ship position, left part: ($09 to $C0)
3463   0F1A 7E                                 LD      A,(HL)              
3464   0F1B D6 06                              SUB     $06                 
3465   0F1D 47                                 LD      B,A                 
3466   0F1E 2C                                 INC     L                   
3467   0F1F 4E                                 LD      C,(HL)              
3468   0F20 21 70 4B                           LD      HL,M4B70            ; 
3469   0F23             L0F23:
3470   0F23 7E                                 LD      A,(HL)              
3471   0F24 2C                                 INC     L                   
3472   0F25 2C                                 INC     L                   
3473   0F26 E6 08                              AND     $08                 
3474   0F28 C4 38 0F                           CALL    NZ,L0F38            ; 
3475   0F2B 2C                                 INC     L                   
3476   0F2C 2C                                 INC     L                   
3477   0F2D 3E B0                              LD      A,$B0               
3478   0F2F BD                                 CP      L                   
3479   0F30 C2 23 0F                           JP      NZ,L0F23            ; 
3480   0F33 C9                                 RET                         
3481   0F34             
3482   0F38                                    .ORG $0F38
3483   0F38             ;*****************************************************************************
3484   0F38             ;* Find the specific colliding alien (small box). HL -> alien screen X (+2).
3485   0F38             ;* B/C = ship X bounds. Alien Y must be in the bottom band ($D2,$E7).
3486   0F38             ;*****************************************************************************
3487   0F38             L0F38:
3488   0F38 2C                                 INC     L                   
3489   0F39 7E                                 LD      A,(HL)              
3490   0F3A 2D                                 DEC     L                   
