5656   24F2             ;*****************************************************************************
5657   24F2             ;* Mother ship bomb attack (reached from L24A0 on level >= 8, when
5658   24F2             ;* Counter9A+1 & 3 == 3). Randomly targets the player's column, then fires.
5659   24F2             ;* Purpose:
5660   24F2             ;* On mother ship levels this fires a bomb only when a random number happens
5661   24F2             ;* to line up horizontally with the player ship (a "semi aimed" attack,
5662   24F2             ;* further rate limited by the `Counter9A` gate). It builds the bomb's `B`=X / `C`=Y
5663   24F2             ;* (Y derived from the scroll counter) and jumps into the shared spawner `L25B7`.
5664   24F2             ;* The two `PUSH HL` match the two `POP HL` that `L25B7`/`L25E0` do on exit.
5665   24F2             ;*****************************************************************************
