8145   3930             ;*****************************************************************************
8146   3930             ;* Bird bomb-drop dispatcher:
8147   3930             ;* For the birds currently in the active scroll band (from T3DC0),
8148   3930             ;* check which sit over the player and have them drop a bomb.
8149   3930             ;* The active-object window (start index + count) comes from `T3DC0`
8150   3930             ;* indexed by the scroll phase; the player danger window `(B,C)`
8151   3930             ;* is the player's mapped X position widened by `D` (from `L3A00`).
8152   3930             ;*****************************************************************************
8153   3930             L3930:
8154   3930 3A D2 4B                           LD      A,(M4BD2)           ; 
8155   3933 E6 1E                              AND     $1E                 
